== Primary Stats ==
:''See also: [[Game Mechanics]], [[Skills]]''
[[File:Amax stats.png|thumb|right|Example view of primary and secondary statistics]]
You choose your character's stats when you create it, and have to live with the decision thereafter.  There is no one perfect way to set up an individual character class.  Much of it depends on your playing style, your preferences, and the decision you make about how you want your character to make his or her way through the world.  Below are the basic descriptions of how the stats affect the characters.

